431 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 231 0 R
/E (Winter Wonderlawn opens Friday, November 6, on the five-acre Skylawn rooftop at POST Houston downtown. The rooftop is covered in thousands of lights, with two 35-foot Christmas trees, forests of candy canes, a Santa's village and new holiday sculptures, including a 100-foot Polar Express. POST Market's food hall is downstairs for dinner before or after. Tickets are needed for the rooftop after 5 pm. Before Thanksgiving they're $8 Monday through Thursday and $15 Friday through Sunday, and kids 6 and under get in free. After Thanksgiving, Santa visits on Sunday evenings with real falling snow.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
